{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0b79aa9dc5a833d8da2","chatId":"c8f5d26a98854ac2b23051908ac2b33f","sessionId":null,"userId":98514,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1174,"promptTokens":1504,"completionTokens":50,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690552065739459,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b79aa9dc5a833d8da1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482359240,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0b79aa9dc5a833d8da1","chatId":"c8f5d26a98854ac2b23051908ac2b33f","sessionId":null,"userId":98514,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n分手后，小娜不想让人想起她的前任。在打扫房间的时候，她在垃圾桶里发现了一封信的碎片，就问妈妈这是怎么回事。她妈妈告诉她这封信是她的前任写的，她决定把它撕了扔掉。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小娜最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 生气\nB) 感激\nC) 反对\nD) 反感\nE) 嫉妒\nF) 期待\n\n## 问题 2\n小娜为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她不想让人想起她的前任，她妈妈把信扔了，不让她看到\nB) 她的妈妈向她展示了前男友的旧信件\nC) 她的妈妈给了她很好的分手应对建议\nD) 在分手后，小娜能够清理她的房间。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690552065739459,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b79aa9dc5a833d8da2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482359237,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6b97fb93b83349358ba18656978fbb76"}